OL,3,ATrain attacker said 'I am the baddest',
OL,4,Atrial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road in
OL,7,FPeterborough, denies 14 counts of
OL,8,Fattempted murder over events on the
OL,9,Ftrain, and beforehand in Peterborough
OL,10,Fand London.
